  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Therapy for 50 Children with Disability in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide early intervention therapy for 50 children with disability particularly Cerebral Palsy through Physio, occupational expressive  and speech therapy. It will empower them to be independent and develop their social skills. Parents and caregivers will also be empowered to improve on care and other service delivery. The project will target children of indigent families who cannot access these services in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
